@S3UploadApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5223

### Upload de arquivo (multipart/form-data)
POST {{S3UploadApi_HostAddress}}/api/upload?key=exemplo.txt
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

--WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="exemplo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

conteudo de exemplo
--WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

GET {{S3UploadApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
